  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tsogolo Langa Family Planning Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This targeted investment programme will expand DFID&#x2019;s current support for family planning service delivery via quality national third-party provider(s) &#x2013; with a view to increasingly meeting needs of youth and younger couples by 30 April 2024.</narrative>
